---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | KRIYANO"
  description="Read the KRIYANO Privacy Policy and learn how website data, analytics, cookies and third-party services may be handled."
>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-kicker">Legal</div>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-intro">
        This Privacy Policy explains how KRIYANO may collect, use and protect
        information when you visit or use this website.
      </p>

      <p class="updated">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section">
    <div class="container legal-layout">
      <article class="legal-content">
        <section>
          <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
          <p>
            KRIYANO does not currently require visitors to create an account or
            provide personal information in order to browse most of the website.
          </p>

          <p>
            Basic technical and usage information may be collected automatically
            when you visit the site. This can include information such as browser
            type, device type, operating system, approximate location, pages
            visited, referring pages, performance data and general website usage
            information.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Website analytics</h2>
          <p>
            KRIYANO may use analytics and performance services to understand how
            visitors use the website, identify technical issues and improve site
            performance and usability.
          </p>

          <p>
            The website currently uses Cloudflare services, including website
            traffic, performance and analytics features. Cloudflare may process
            technical information in accordance with its own privacy practices.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
          <p>
            KRIYANO may use cookies or similar technologies where necessary for
            website functionality, security, analytics, advertising or other
            services.
          </p>

          <p>
            If advertising or additional analytics services are introduced in
            the future, they may use cookies or similar technologies in
            accordance with their respective privacy policies and applicable
            requirements.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Advertising</h2>
          <p>
            KRIYANO may display advertising in the future, including advertising
            provided by third-party advertising networks such as Google AdSense.
          </p>

          <p>
            Advertising providers may use cookies or other technologies to
            deliver, measure or personalise advertisements where permitted.
            Additional disclosures may be added to this Privacy Policy when such
            services are implemented.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. Third-party links and services</h2>
          <p>
            KRIYANO may contain links to third-party websites, AI platforms,
            software, products or services. KRIYANO is not responsible for the
            privacy practices, content or policies of external websites.
          </p>

          <p>
            Visitors should review the privacy policies of third-party services
            before providing personal information to them.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. AI tools and prompts</h2>
          <p>
            KRIYANO provides tools, prompts, guides and educational resources
            designed to help users work with artificial intelligence services.
          </p>

          <p>
            Unless specifically stated otherwise, users should avoid entering
            confidential, sensitive or personally identifiable information into
            prompts or tools that may later be submitted to third-party AI
            platforms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>7. Data security</h2>
          <p>
            Reasonable technical measures are used to help protect the website
            and its infrastructure. However, no internet transmission or online
            service can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>8. Children's privacy</h2>
          <p>
            KRIYANO is intended as a general information, productivity and
            educational website and is not specifically directed toward young
            children.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            This Privacy Policy may be updated when KRIYANO introduces new
            features, analytics systems, advertising services, forms, downloads,
            accounts or other functionality.
          </p>

          <p>
            The latest version will be published on this page together with an
            updated revision date.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>10. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact
            KRIYANO through the contact information provided on the website.
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding: 100px 0 70px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 80% 20%,
        rgba(183, 255, 74, 0.08),
        transparent 30%
      ),
      var(--bg);
  }

  .legal-hero h1 {
    margin-top: 16px;
    max-width: 850px;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.8rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  .legal-intro {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-top: 26px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .updated {
    margin-top: 20px;
    color: var(--lime);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .legal-section {
    padding: 85px 0 110px;
  }

  .legal-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 820px);
  }

  .legal-content {
    display: grid;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .legal-content section {
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .legal-content section:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    margin-top: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .legal-content p:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .legal-hero {
      padding: 64px 0 48px;
    }

    .legal-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 13vw, 4rem);
    }

    .legal-intro {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .legal-section {
      padding: 58px 0 75px;
    }

    .legal-content {
      gap: 34px;
    }

    .legal-content section {
      padding-bottom: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>